    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Duck, dodge and toss. <strong>Los Pingheros</strong> is a multiplayer brawler for up to <strong>8\u00a0players online or local</strong>. Join hectic battles in various modes and strive to become the ultimate <strong>Pinghero</strong> in Mexico by snowing your opponents out of the arena. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/59c6bc948638443f6c92b94f8c1416b9.avif?t=1753352237\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Penguin Snowdown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join an exhilarating multiplayer action for memorable frenzied battles, playable with up to 8 players online and locally. Dive into the vibrant colors of Mexico, draped in a unique snowy mantle, and join the action alone or with your friends.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/b5ff184273c22f0bb203682b5c7077dc.poster.avif?t=1753352237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/b5ff184273c22f0bb203682b5c7077dc.webm?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/b5ff184273c22f0bb203682b5c7077dc.mp4?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Brawl Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for thrilling and diverse confrontations across a variety of modes, where only the most cunning penguins emerge victorious: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2744\ufe0f Snowball School:</strong> This mode introduces players to the game\u2019s mechanics through timed challenges, which can be completed either solo or up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude85 <strong>Carnaval Cup:</strong> A chaotic mode where the rules change every round! It\u2019s a wild mix of different game modes (details below). First to reach 12 Sols takes the cup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Skill Storm</strong>: Power up your Pinghero with extra skills between rounds, ramping up the action and strategy with every battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Custom</strong>: Pick your rules, choose your maps, and create your own perfect showdown!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/9e55093764000079971f04cd68332716.poster.avif?t=1753352237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/9e55093764000079971f04cd68332716.webm?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/9e55093764000079971f04cd68332716.mp4?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Penguin Techniques</strong> - Access to the penguin's top survival tricks: the ultimate slide, the renowned penguin spinning top, and the celebrated &quot;Made in Penguin&quot; chokeslam, where your opponent definitely won't be pretending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/21e714a2b7c63a7ee2c20305b7031212.poster.avif?t=1753352237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/21e714a2b7c63a7ee2c20305b7031212.webm?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/21e714a2b7c63a7ee2c20305b7031212.mp4?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart Your Opponents</strong> - Destroy the cacti to uncover power-ups. Be smart on how you use them! Keep an eye on the luchador mask that enrages your penguin, and game-changing items like the magic snowflake to freeze all other penguins to the bone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/ae4e5d458ca6cd0529144040b0da8797.poster.avif?t=1753352237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/ae4e5d458ca6cd0529144040b0da8797.webm?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/ae4e5d458ca6cd0529144040b0da8797.mp4?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mexican Dressing Room</strong> - Customize your penguins to reflect your unique style. As you progress, you unlock new clothing, hats, and color palettes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/0a18bf9e5b0997de3d81d3589ba3c0dd.poster.avif?t=1753352237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/0a18bf9e5b0997de3d81d3589ba3c0dd.webm?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418600/extras/0a18bf9e5b0997de3d81d3589ba3c0dd.mp4?t=1753352237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not alone</strong> - Watch out for your webbed feet ! In Mexico, you won't be alone. Slide in the wrong place and you might get bitten. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Up to 8 players local, online, or mixed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Play free for all or team with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Unique Snowy Mexican setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Loads of power-ups and game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Cooperative Challenge mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Destruct and construct the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Customize your Penguin and unlock even more as you progress!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full content list</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Session Types</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude85 <strong>Carnaval Cup</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Skill Storm</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Custom</strong></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 game modes:</strong> All these modes can be played in <strong>Carnaval Cup</strong>, where they\u2019re randomly selected, or in <strong>Custom Battle</strong>, where you choose your favorites!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Score Spree</strong>: Rack up the highest score before time runs out to claim victory! (Free For All/Team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc27 Ultimo Pinghero</strong>: A battle royale showdown\u2014last penguin standing wins! (FFA /Team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 El Kinghero</strong>: Hold the zone to earn points\u2014first to 100 takes the crown! (FFA /Team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd2 Frost Puck</strong>: Fast-paced ice hockey\u2014team up and push the puck to score! (Team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa <strong>Juggernaut</strong>: One player is superpowered\u2014team up to take them down or survive as the Juggernaut to win! (Team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2696\ufe0f Same Boats</strong>: Everyone gets the same over-the-top powers\u2014who can master them best? (FFA /Team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Spicy Steps</strong>: You're on fire and the ice is melting\u2014keep moving to outlast the rest! (FFA /Team)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f 12 Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 9 Challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 9 Items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 18 Skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 10 Pingheros Colors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde5 26 Pingheros Skins</strong></p></li></ul>",
